|-----------|-------------------|
| `chats.accept_proposal` | `accept_proposal` |
| `chats.reject_proposal` | `reject_proposal` |
| `chats.request_proposal_revision` | `request_proposal_revision` |
| `chats.decline_revision_request` | `decline_revision_request` |
| `chats.close_conversation` | `cns_close_conversation` |
| `chats.cancel_service_request` | `cancel_service_request` |
| `chats.submit_proposal` | `create_provider_proposal` |
| `chats.initiate_conversation` | `cns_initiate_conversation` |
| `request_quote.create_order` | Edge `create-request-quote-order` + `create_request_quote_service_request` |

## New mutations checklist

1. Add `p_idempotency_key uuid` (NOT NULL) to RPC signature.
2. Pick namespaced `operation` string; document in this table.
3. Implement begin/commit (or `_for_actor` variant for Edge).
4. Client API: accept optional `idempotencyKey`, default generate, **stable ref on retry**.
5. pgTAP: duplicate key returns cached body; hash mismatch raises conflict.

## Retention

No automatic prune yet. Plan TTL cron when volume grows (similar to `cns_prune_job_runs`).
